PORT=3000
CORS_ORIGIN=https://my‑frontend.com
```

---

## 7️⃣ (Optional) Add a “catch‑all 404” handler

```js
// 404 – route not found
app.use((req, res) => {
  res.status(404).json({ error: 'Not Found' });
});
```

Place it **before** the generic error handler so that the 404 does not get logged as a server error.

---

## 8️⃣ Full revised file (concise version)

Below is a condensed version that you can copy‑paste into `app.js`.  
Feel free to split it into separate modules (routes, middleware, config) as the project grows.

